5:["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-6","children":["About ","Leightons Opticians & Hearing Care"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Leightons is a family-owned opticians and hearing care provider established in 1928, operating primarily across southern England. They are known for their premium, personalised service and investment in the latest clinical technology, including advanced OCT scanning and myopia management for children. Leightons holds a reputation for thorough eye examinations that go well beyond the standard NHS sight test."}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Leightons Opticians was founded in 1928 by Henry Oscar Leighton in the town of Marlow, Buckinghamshire. From its earliest days, the practice distinguished itself through meticulous attention to patient care and a commitment to investing in the best available clinical equipment. The business remained in the Leighton family for decades, gradually expanding across the Home Counties and southern England while maintaining the personal, community-focused ethos that had defined the original practice."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Throughout the latter half of the twentieth century, Leightons grew steadily, opening new branches in affluent towns across Surrey, Hampshire, Berkshire, and Sussex. The company was an early adopter of new optical technology, introducing computerised eye testing equipment and OCT scanning before many of its competitors. In the 2000s, Leightons expanded its services to include hearing care, recognising the overlap between vision and hearing health in its predominantly older patient demographic. The combined opticians-and-audiologists model allowed patients to manage both aspects of their sensory health in a single appointment."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Today, Leightons operates approximately 35 practices across southern England and remains privately owned and family-run. The company has developed a strong reputation for its \"Ultimate Eye Examination\" — a comprehensive assessment that includes OCT scanning, visual field testing, digital retinal photography, and a detailed consultation that typically lasts 45 minutes to an hour. Leightons also offers a specialist myopia management service for children, using the latest evidence-based interventions to slow the progression of short-sightedness. The brand positions itself firmly at the premium end of the market, prioritising clinical depth and personalised care over volume and price competition."}]]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 h-fit","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-4","children":"Quick Facts"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"Founded"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"1928"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"UK Stores"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"35"}]]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"]}]]}]]}]}]
