2c:["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Leightons operates approximately 35 branches across southern England, concentrated in the Home Counties and along the south coast. You will find Leightons practices in areas including London, Surrey, Hampshire, Berkshire, Sussex, Kent, and Buckinghamshire. They do not currently have branches in the Midlands, the North of England, Scotland, Wales, or Northern Ireland."}]}]
2d:["$","details","3",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Is Leightons more expensive than Specsavers or Boots?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Leightons is positioned at the premium end of the market, and their prices are generally higher than mainstream chains like Specsavers, Boots, or ASDA. However, the higher cost reflects longer appointment times, more advanced diagnostic technology, and a greater depth of clinical assessment. Many patients who have switched to Leightons report that the difference in the thoroughness and quality of the examination justifies the additional cost. NHS eye tests are available free to eligible patients, just as at any other optician."}]}]]}]
2e:["$","details","4",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Does Leightons offer hearing aids?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, many Leightons branches provide a full audiology service alongside their optical care. They work with leading hearing aid manufacturers including Phonak, Oticon, Widex, and Signia, offering a range of devices from discreet in-ear models to powerful behind-the-ear aids. Hearing assessments are free, and audiologists will explain all available options, including the differences between NHS-funded and private hearing aids."}]}]]}]
2f:["$","details","5",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"Can I get an NHS eye test at Leightons?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, Leightons provides free NHS-funded eye tests for all eligible patients. This includes children under 16, adults over 60, people receiving certain means-tested benefits, and patients with specific medical conditions such as diabetes or glaucoma. If you also want the enhanced tests included in the Ultimate Eye Examination — such as OCT scanning and visual fields — these are available at an additional cost."}]}]]}]
30:["$","details","6",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] text-left","children":"How do I book an appointment at Leightons through eyetest.co.uk?"}],["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","fill":"none","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","d":"M19 9l-7 7-7-7"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-6 pb-5","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"You can search for your nearest Leightons branch by entering your postcode on eyetest.co.uk. The results will show you available appointment types, prices, and time slots. Select the service you want, pick a convenient date and time, enter your details, and confirm the booking. You will receive an email confirmation with all the information you need for your visit."}]}]]}]
